00:21:39.923 --> 00:21:41.008
-Last one.
-Last drink.

00:21:41.091 --> 00:21:42.968
Yeah, we said it at the same time.

00:21:47.055 --> 00:21:50.225
So, what's your, uh...
what's your dating life like?

00:21:50.809 --> 00:21:52.769
There are so many options in the city.

00:21:52.853 --> 00:21:56.356
There are so many options,
but sometimes, I think that people...

00:21:58.483 --> 00:22:01.069
-swipe past the best thing out there.
-Yeah.

00:22:01.153 --> 00:22:02.988
They're constantly looking
for something amazing

00:22:03.071 --> 00:22:06.533
and there's something amazing sitting
right in front of them, and they're like,

00:22:06.616 --> 00:22:08.327
not focused on it. You know what I mean?

00:22:08.410 --> 00:22:10.287
Like, they're just looking
for the next thing,

00:22:10.370 --> 00:22:13.582
and then maybe one day, they wake up
down the road and they're like, "Uh."

00:22:13.665 --> 00:22:14.583
-Yeah.
-Like...

00:22:14.958 --> 00:22:18.378
"Wow, the third swipe in. That was it,
and instead I just kept going."

00:22:18.462 --> 00:22:20.672
Right. Because you wanted to see
what else was out there.

00:22:20.756 --> 00:22:21.798
Exactly.

00:22:22.466 --> 00:22:25.969
This is gonna be
one of my favorite stories to tell.

00:22:26.053 --> 00:22:26.928
[laughs]

00:22:27.012 --> 00:22:28.472
To our grandchildren, right?

00:22:28.555 --> 00:22:29.890
-Oh.
-Is that-- [laughs]

00:22:29.973 --> 00:22:31.808
-[chuckles] Cheers for that.
-Yeah?

00:22:32.017 --> 00:22:33.060
[Betty laughs]

00:22:33.852 --> 00:22:35.687
-All right. There we go.
-Yeah.

00:22:40.859 --> 00:22:41.693
[exhales]

00:22:42.319 --> 00:22:44.488
-It's, like, getting so late.
-Yeah.

00:22:44.780 --> 00:22:46.490
-[laughs]
-I'm getting so sleepy.

00:22:46.740 --> 00:22:47.574
I know.

00:22:48.492 --> 00:22:50.827
-Let's sleep here. Should we sleep here?
-Yeah.

00:22:50.911 --> 00:22:53.205
-It's a very comfortable couch, right?
-Okay. Tired. See?

00:22:53.663 --> 00:22:55.082
Let's just sleep here then.

00:22:56.666 --> 00:22:58.835
You're so tired.
Thanks so much for everything.

00:22:58.919 --> 00:23:00.837
-Yeah.
-Definitely.

00:23:01.505 --> 00:23:02.714
Are we sleeping now?

00:23:03.632 --> 00:23:05.175
-Almost.
-Yeah.

00:23:06.468 --> 00:23:08.762
-Yeah.
-What are you thinking?

00:23:10.847 --> 00:23:11.723
Um...

00:23:12.682 --> 00:23:14.559
I don't know. We should probably--

00:23:15.143 --> 00:23:17.229
-We should probably get out of here soon.
-Yeah.

00:23:17.312 --> 00:23:18.480
-Should we go?
-Yeah.

00:23:19.022 --> 00:23:19.856
Okay.

00:23:20.190 --> 00:23:21.274
-You ready?
-Yeah.

00:23:21.358 --> 00:23:22.275
-Okay.
-Let's go.

00:23:30.867 --> 00:23:31.993
[Victoria walks into door]

00:23:32.077 --> 00:23:33.286
[Victoria chuckling]

00:23:33.370 --> 00:23:34.413
Oh, wait hold on.

00:23:34.496 --> 00:23:36.164
[both laughing]

00:23:38.500 --> 00:23:39.334
There you go.

00:23:41.336 --> 00:23:43.505
I just walked face-first into that.

00:23:45.298 --> 00:23:46.883
[horns honking in the distance]

00:23:52.514 --> 00:23:53.890
Let me haul up my pants.

00:23:53.974 --> 00:23:55.392
-[grunts]
-Yep, there you go.

00:23:56.309 --> 00:23:58.061
Pure class all the way. Keep going.

00:23:58.145 --> 00:24:00.313
I can't believe--
So you're always this fun.

00:24:00.647 --> 00:24:01.648
This is who you are.

00:24:01.940 --> 00:24:04.609
Like, I feel like you're subbing in "fun"
for, like, "strange,"

00:24:04.693 --> 00:24:07.446
-but, yes, I am. I am like this 24/7.
-It's incredible.

00:24:07.529 --> 00:24:09.990
Why? Why, you don't meet a lot of...

00:24:10.949 --> 00:24:15.954
-random women on blind dates out at bars?
-I can say this with 100% accuracy.

00:24:16.037 --> 00:24:18.957
