like you before, ever.

00:24:19.040 --> 00:24:20.500
[both laugh]

00:24:20.584 --> 00:24:21.835
I'm just telling you.

00:24:22.210 --> 00:24:24.754
I like to be fat, and I like to eat food,

00:24:25.172 --> 00:24:29.342
and I like to be, like,
not socially acceptable.

00:24:30.302 --> 00:24:32.429
-Just so you know.
-Yeah.

00:24:32.929 --> 00:24:34.306
[loudly smacks lips]

00:24:34.681 --> 00:24:36.099
You just smack your lips,

00:24:36.808 --> 00:24:39.227
-taste the food as good as you can.
-Taste the food.

00:24:39.311 --> 00:24:40.187
Taste it.

00:24:41.771 --> 00:24:44.858
It's, like, nice to go out
with a foodie that knows

00:24:45.400 --> 00:24:46.943
