-You as well.

00:24:54.451 --> 00:24:55.285
But, um...

00:24:59.998 --> 00:25:00.832
Yeah.

00:25:06.963 --> 00:25:09.299
-We should hang out again. It'll be fun.
-Yeah.

00:25:09.758 --> 00:25:10.634
Um...

00:25:11.218 --> 00:25:12.052
Yeah.

00:25:12.844 --> 00:25:15.764
I think I would enjoy seeing you again.

00:25:16.598 --> 00:25:18.475
We should exchange numbers and--

00:25:18.558 --> 00:25:20.393
-Definitely. Yeah. For sure.
-Let's do that.

00:25:23.271 --> 00:25:24.773
