-I know. Thank you.

00:25:53.009 --> 00:25:54.678
Okay. All right.

00:25:54.761 --> 00:25:57.180
-I had fun. Thank you for everything.
-I had fun with you, too.

00:25:59.558 --> 00:26:01.893
